==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**15 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

